                "audio": "cf7ebab054c4582cc5b298c38c5b62f5fb3eb71a9e8d00535ef463cb62751b30"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A partner asked you to come today. You explained that you could not and apologized. You both agreed to tomorrow instead. The time tomorrow still needs to be chosen; no visit has occurred. Write a handover preserving request, agreement and remaining action.\nFamiliar meanings available: to answer; to respond; to apologize; suggest; suggestion; because; owing to; to agree; to consent."
          }
        ]
